# Bead 1: a plastic pony bead in mint green (toy_plastic_mint), 0.54 m across and 0.4 m tall (60 times life size), standing on end on the floor,
# a ring with a wide hole, a round hole through it. Ground clutter: no collider.
format 1

# An eighth of the vertices its size would give it: a small plain ring
Detail detail=0.12
    Material material=toy_plastic_mint
        Translate translation=(0, 0.2, 0)
            Subtraction
                RoundedCylinder radius=0.27 roundness=0.12 height=0.2
                CappedCylinder radius=0.14 height=0.3
